    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jinn Hunter</strong> is a fast-paced, stylish hack and slash. You are Bilal and Bahaal, a pair of elite Jinn hunters tasked to investigate the fabled City of Brass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a single-player campaign that stretches across three gorgeously rendered levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamlessly swap characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between skilled Bilal and brutal Bahaal at the press of a button. Flip between characters to extend combos or leverage their skillsets against enemies and the environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilal uses a scimitar, blunderbuss, and acrobatic skill to dismantle his enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bahaal leverages a massive greatsword and her supernatural strength to crush everything that stands in her way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/a74d54414ff806e3ac2113f87592a2c5.poster.avif?t=1738610796\" width=360 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/a74d54414ff806e3ac2113f87592a2c5.webm?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/a74d54414ff806e3ac2113f87592a2c5.mp4?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform across gorgeous architecture and dastardly traps, discover ancient secrets, and smash enemies into gorgeous architectural features as you traverse the ancient City of Brass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you to the city's very heart, revealing secrets about its purpose, fall, and your mysterious employer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Topple Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on six pulse-pounding boss battles. Monstrous jinn, titanic constructs, rogue hunters and more stand in your path. Each presents a unique challenge, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Hunter Omer, who has grafted a titanic cannon to his right arm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stalwart jinn Nasir, who will stop at nothing to maintain the City's ancient sanctity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/7dc2ae6eef045fb2008a7e49b849ad29.poster.avif?t=1738610796\" width=180 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/7dc2ae6eef045fb2008a7e49b849ad29.webm?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/7dc2ae6eef045fb2008a7e49b849ad29.mp4?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jinn Hunter</strong> is a fast-paced, stylish hack and slash. You are Bilal and Bahaal, a pair of elite Jinn hunters tasked to investigate the fabled City of Brass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a single-player campaign that stretches across three gorgeously rendered levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamlessly swap characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between skilled Bilal and brutal Bahaal at the press of a button. Flip between characters to extend combos or leverage their skillsets against enemies and the environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilal uses a scimitar, blunderbuss, and acrobatic skill to dismantle his enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bahaal leverages a massive greatsword and her supernatural strength to crush everything that stands in her way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/a74d54414ff806e3ac2113f87592a2c5.poster.avif?t=1738610796\" width=360 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/a74d54414ff806e3ac2113f87592a2c5.webm?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/a74d54414ff806e3ac2113f87592a2c5.mp4?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform across gorgeous architecture and dastardly traps, discover ancient secrets, and smash enemies into gorgeous architectural features as you traverse the ancient City of Brass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you to the city's very heart, revealing secrets about its purpose, fall, and your mysterious employer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Topple Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on six pulse-pounding boss battles. Monstrous jinn, titanic constructs, rogue hunters and more stand in your path. Each presents a unique challenge, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Hunter Omer, who has grafted a titanic cannon to his right arm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stalwart jinn Nasir, who will stop at nothing to maintain the City's ancient sanctity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/7dc2ae6eef045fb2008a7e49b849ad29.poster.avif?t=1738610796\" width=180 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/7dc2ae6eef045fb2008a7e49b849ad29.webm?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353590/extras/7dc2ae6eef045fb2008a7e49b849ad29.mp4?t=1738610796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In Jinn Hunter, you play a pair of superhuman hunters on a journey to unravel the secrets of the mysterious City of Brass. Seamlessly switch between characters and master their movesets in pulse-pounding battles to cut your way through enemies both human and monstrous.",
